// villager_voices -- reference EMF animation snippet (VV-12, docs/spec/domains/compat.md
// COMPAT-REQ-005). Not a loaded game asset of this mod's own: shipped here, under docs/, not under
// assets/, so it registers nothing and affects no in-game model on its own.
//
// A minimal jaw-bone rotation keyed to villager_voices.is_talking (COMPAT-REQ-004), illustrative
// only -- copy the "condition" and "bones" shape into a real EMF/CEM animation JSON authored against
// whichever mouth-bone name a compatible model actually uses. Fresh Animations itself has no
// confirmed dedicated jaw/mouth bone for the villager model as of this ticket (research
// villager-events-sounds-and-emf-compat.md §D2, labelled inferred not confirmed) -- this snippet
// exists so a pack author, including a future Fresh-Animations-style pack that adds one, has a
// working example to copy, not because Fresh Animations supports it today.
{
  "description": "villager_voices reference snippet -- copy into a compatible model's own animation file",
  "condition": "query.variable('villager_voices.is_talking')",
  "bones": {
    "head_mouth": {
      "rotation": ["math.sin(query.anim_time * 4000) * 6", 0, 0]
    }
  }
}
